    "name": "Italian Plum",
    "description": "<p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">Italian plums are small, egg-shaped stone fruit with dark purple-black skin, a dusty natural \"bloom\" coating, and sweet-tart greenish-yellow flesh that easily pulls away from the pit. </span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><b><strong class=\"lexical-text-editor--bold\" style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">Flavor &amp; Texture:</strong></b><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"> Dense, firm flesh offering a balanced sweet-and-sour taste that turns juicy and vibrant fuchsia-pink when cooked.</span></p>",
